Communication Architecture (Choose One)
Option A: SiK Pair Drone↔Rover (Recommended for Production)

Rover ── SiK ──≈≈≈── SiK ── Drone Cube ── USB ── Pi
Latency: ~30 ms     |   Rover data flows directly to Pi
Cost: ~₹3,000       |   No laptop in data path
Option B: Laptop Forwards Rover via Drone RC TX (No SiK, All Physical)

Rover → rover TX → Laptop (MAVProxy forward) → drone TX (uplink) → drone Cube → USB → Pi
Latency: ~250 ms    |   No new hardware
Cost: ₹0            |   Slower; OK for ≤0.5 m/s rover
Option C: UDP from Laptop to Pi via WiFi

Both Cubes → Laptop USB → MAVProxy → WiFi UDP → Pi
Latency: ~80 ms     |   Requires WiFi link
Note: Can be unreliable; WiFi can drop
