5. The precland.py Script
State Machine

┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│         IDLE                    │
│  Pilot in LOITER/STABILIZE      │
│  Script just observes           │
│  Sends LANDING_TARGET if tag    │
└──────────┬──────────────────────┘
           │ Pilot manually switches
           │ to GUIDED mode
           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│       APPROACH                  │
│  Script controls drone          │
│  Three sub-modes:               │
│    MODE A: VISUAL (tag seen)    │
│    MODE B: GPS-NAV (rover GPS)  │
│    MODE C: HOVER (nothing)      │
└──────────┬──────────────────────┘
           │ Touchdown detected
           │ (alt < 0.3m, climb≈0, 1s)
           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│        LANDED                   │
│  DISARM command sent            │
│  → IDLE after disarm confirmed  │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
Three Navigation Modes Inside APPROACH
MODE A — VISUAL (tag detected)

vx = rover_velocity_x + Kp × angle_x
vy = rover_velocity_y + Kp × angle_y
vz = descent_visual(altitude, centered)
Used when AprilTag is visible. Visual P-controller + rover velocity feed-forward.

MODE B — GPS-NAV (no tag, rover GPS available)

distance, bearing = haversine(drone.lat,lon, rover.lat,lon)
vx_body, vy_body = rotate(velocity_toward_rover, drone.yaw)
vz = descent_gps(distance, altitude)
Used when drone is too far from rover for tag detection. Flies toward rover GPS.

MODE C — HOVER (no tag, no rover)

vx = vy = vz = 0
Safety fallback. After 15 s: warns operator.

Descent Profile
Condition	vz (m/s)
Altitude < 0.3 m (any mode)	0.6 (committed touchdown)
Altitude < 5 m, tag centered (< 5°)	0.5 (terminal)
Altitude < 5 m, tag off-center	0.1 (creep)
Altitude > 5 m, tag visible, centered	0.3
Altitude > 5 m, tag visible, off-center	0.2
GPS-NAV, distance > 20 m	0.0 (hover, slide)
GPS-NAV, distance 8–20 m	0.2
GPS-NAV, distance < 8 m	0.3
Touchdown Detection

IF altitude < 0.3 m AND |climb_rate| < 0.10 m/s for 1 second:
    Send force-disarm command (MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM with magic 21196)
    State → LANDED
Velocity Caps
Horizontal: ±2 m/s
Vertical: ±0.8 m/s
Pilot Override
At ANY point during APPROACH, pilot flipping RC switch out of GUIDED:

Script detects mode change
Stops sending commands
Returns to IDLE
Pilot has full RC control
BENCH_MODE Safety Flag
Set via environment variable BENCH=1. When active:

vz forced to 0 (no descent)
Touchdown auto-disarm disabled
Banner printed at startup
Log entries tagged [BENCH]
