16. Key Decisions Made
Decision	Choice	Reason
Marker type	AprilTag tag36h11	Proven, robust, well-supported library
Compute platform	Raspberry Pi 5	Sufficient for AprilTag (no ML), cheap, light
Engagement	Pilot manually triggers GUIDED	Safety — never script-initiated mode change
Architecture	Lua-style — script controls in GUIDED until touchdown	Avoids ArduPilot LAND mode rigidity for moving platforms
Sensor data	Camera only currently; LiDAR TBD	Minimal MVP first
Camera	OV5647 5MP rolling shutter	Available now; GS planned
Rover comms	TBD (SiK pair vs RC TX backchannel)	Trade latency vs cost
Bench safety	BENCH=1 env variable	Force hover, disable disarm
